          "message_id": "a36044d4-1923-4fa4-9364-a356fa603dc5",
          "content": "Here's how to create a Facebook App on Meta for Developers:\n\n**1. Go to Meta for Developers**\n- Visit [developers.facebook.com](https://developers.facebook.com)\n- Click **My Apps** → **Create App**\n\n**2. Choose App Type**\n- Select **\"Other\"** → then **\"Business\"** type (this gives you access to Pages API)\n\n**3. Fill in App Details**\n- App name (e.g. \"Facebook News Agent\")\n- Contact email\n- Business portfolio (optional at this stage)\n\n**4. Add the Pages Product**\n- Inside your app dashboard, find **\"Add Products\"**\n- Add **\"Pages API\"** — this lets you post to a Facebook Page\n\n**5. Get Your Page Access Token**\n- Go to **Tools → Graph API Explorer**\n- Select your app\n- Click **\"Generate Access Token\"**\n- Select your Facebook Page and grant these permissions:\n  - `pages_manage_posts`\n  - `pages_read_engagement`\n- Copy the token — this goes into your `.env` file as `FACEBOOK_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN`\n\n**6. Get Your Page ID**\n- In Graph API Explorer, query: `me/accounts`\n- Copy the `id` of your page — this goes into `.env` as `FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID`\n\n**7. Add to your `.env`**\n```\nFACEBOOK_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_token_here\nFACEBOOK_PAGE_ID=your_page_id_here\n```\n\nOnce you have those two values, I can implement Phase 3 — the publishing integration — into the agent. Just let me know when you're ready!"
